# Editor and build litter that accumulates in this working folder.
#
# Everything listed here is untracked scratch, not deliberate content: 38 untracked entries were
# hiding the three or four that matter in `git status`, which is a real cost the moment more than
# one person or session works here. Nothing is deleted by this file -- it only stops the noise
# being reported. The stale script variants (O2_TGeoToCAD*.py, O2_CADtoTGeo_with_*.py) are left
# visible on purpose: one of them is about to be revived for the TGeo -> STEP round trip
# (Workstreams.md, Stream E), and picking which needs a human.
*~
